@startuml
' TraceabilityGraph — lifecycle states
' Shows the phases from creation through querying

skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F8F9FA
skinparam stateBorderColor #888888

[*] --> Empty

Empty --> Populated : addItem()
Populated --> Populated : addItem()
Populated --> Complete : addRelationship()
Complete --> Complete : addItem() / addRelationship()
Complete --> Cleared : clear()
Cleared --> Empty

state Empty {
  state "Ready for items" as e1
}

state Populated {
  state "Items registered" as p1
}

state Complete {
  state "Ready for queries" as c1
}

state Complete : << validated? >>
state Complete : validate() checks orphans,\ncircular refs, rule violations

state Cleared {
  state "Graph reset" as cl1
}

note right of Complete
  Pass 3 (link substitution)
  requires Complete state —
  all sourceFiles must be known
  to resolve cross-file xrefs.
end note

note bottom of Complete
  validate() returns ValidationResult
  with errors[] and warnings[].
  Re-validation runs on every
  addItem()/addRelationship() call.
end note

@enduml
